name": "4.png", "id": "1470238121060573", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825497_1470238124393906_840229317181390784_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VL4XElDM6SEQ7kNvwEnDgWy&_nc_oc=Adq2Ja9-QQlUYmrhL6QtMS-P-VI37X498MkCmeVdWVvMr-CiHp7SxS_hpA09kkFiyDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSTwqgzJ3A4E6AYYxcYdJxv9s4H8M6cruL8-j_X6UwIkw&oe=6AF32F32"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "4299448770304785", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_4299448773638118_6198794168639950814_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z9K3ffqT5w4Q7kNvwFJv4cE&_nc_oc=Adr7_fef2PoIDEiIRtvxj_I4iS_eAHSbyhSHInJYnQNOCZYCTkKUIHTTk3vViy0gidw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSvTNEMNmfB9XNR8QbXEROJ4K3ALrbRRO50Q4chFzzUJA&oe=6AF35B32"}, {"file_name": "23.png", "id": "824209163781058", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827626_824209167114391_7872222521021636363_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dNhZ97TmVDQQ7kNvwEx5kq1&_nc_oc=AdrGwRmDSGxCfmfn2_CyrzZfGOpCEN3PSzd9SlFDpwkBiqia_moQP1vbFFXnGSC-ZdI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTDKEbJz-sxRumMexQzEWsm4RD9rCmov-pB3X-ziKQ85Q&oe=6AF33BCF"}, {"file_name": "21.png", "id": "967896346033576", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_967896349366909_2954946301595757138_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bRIBOLk_fboQ7kNvwHa7HkJ&_nc_oc=Adr6_fZOtMJVk4884k9hII49KRTYaONRyhgCVFNqbFd4OaWIgpuk3c4XBPQy_L7Ps8A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTecSz6qCqz7yoWJpTGUj1sm2-GaOwHxCaz--y6tE5Ulg&oe=6AF34077"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1531300608639730", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1531300611973063_9058646323360018751_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QR57uZBxIuEQ7kNvwHkGT2A&_nc_oc=AdrQKd8n9JjIcFGFkrSPMqfDc8bULNmbGWHZ8KM6qFOoearsOk6MWTRJ9IkCdELqdU0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSnrlmXiICtubpHNFc2YHeR07Ks7WWT7OiXr0kz2pKiTw&oe=6AF353EA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zombies", "keywords": ["zombie", "shooter", "undead", "ragdoll", "shoot"], "long_description": "Step into a zombie sandbox shooter where physics-driven gameplay, a full-body controller system, and stylized action come together. Experiment freely with a wide variety of weapons as zombies react dynamically, lose limbs, crawl, and collapse in chaotic, physics-based encounters.\n{1274756444826142}\nPlayers can physically grab, aim, reload, and swap weapons with intuitive motion controls, creating a realistic firefight experience that feels natural and engaging. Enjoy precise two-handed rifle support with smooth recoil feedback and interactive magazine mechanics.\n{1639174897351635}\nEnemies are fully ragdolled and react dynamically to damage. Shoot off limbs and watch zombies adapt. Losing legs forces them to crawl. Instead of realistic horror, the game embraces a stylized, exaggerated visual style with non-realistic blood effects designed to keep the experience fun and accessible rather than disturbing.\n\nBuilt as a sandbox, the game encourages experimentation. Test different weapons, and explore how enemies respond to physics-driven destruction. Every encounter becomes a small simulation where movement, impact, and environment all matter.\n\nThis gamefocuses on replayability, physical interaction, and satisfying VR feedback loops.\n\n", "short_description": "A zombie shooter sandbox featuring ragdoll physics, a full-body VR controller, modular weapon support, and stylized combat effects. Experiment with a wide range of weapons while enemies react dynamically, lose limbs, crawl, and collapse in a fun way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://molancegames.com/privacy-policy-3", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "pub